<title>UK: Fire-sticken edible oil carrier discharges cargo.</title>
<headline>Fire-sticken edible oil carrier discharges cargo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Discharge of sunflower oil from the fire-stricken Maltese-flag vessel Tivat has been completed at St.Petersburg, Russia, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said.</p>
<p>Repairs to the 14,114 dwt vessel's hatch cover is to be completed on July 9.</p>
<p>An investigation into the cause of the fire in one of the Tivat's holds and the extent of the damage is still underway.</p>
</text>
